---
import learning from '../data/learning.json';
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
import data from '../data/content.json';
---
<Shell title="Ayah Threads">
  <section class="intro"><div class="intro-top"><span class="eyebrow">Quran puzzle</span> <span class="pill"><span class="dot"></span>{data.puzzles.length} passage puzzles</span></div> <h1>{learning.heading}</h1> <p>Read three ayat, find the thread that connects them, and open the references behind your answer.</p></section>
  <noscript><div class="noscript">The puzzle interactions need JavaScript. The source catalog remains available at <a href="/sources/">Sources</a>.</div></noscript>
  <div class="workspace"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><span class="label" id="puzzle-label">Your next puzzle</span><p>One intended theme. Many things to notice.</p></div> <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="show-arabic"/>Show Arabic</label></div> <div class="panel-body" id="puzzle-stage" aria-live="polite"><p class="muted">Preparing your passages…</p></div></section>
    <aside class="sidebar sticky"><section class="panel panel-body"><h2>Explore another puzzle</h2><label class="field bottom-gap">Choose a puzzle<select id="puzzle-picker">{data.puzzles.map(p=><option value={p.id}>Puzzle {String(p.number).padStart(2,'0')}</option>)}</select></label> <button class="button wide" id="random-puzzle">Surprise me</button><div class="divider"></div> <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="remember"/>Remember my place for up to 30 days</label><p class="micro top-gap" id="progress-note"></p></section>{' '}
    <section class="panel panel-body"><h2>Follow the words</h2><ol><li>Read all three selections in Pickthall's translation.</li> <li>Choose the theme that best connects the set.</li> <li>Open the references and compare the passages in context.</li></ol><div class="divider"></div><button class="text-button" type="button" id="share-puzzle">Copy puzzle link</button></section> <section class="notice"><strong>A starting point for reading</strong><p class="micro">Themes are editorial learning prompts. They do not replace tafsir or claim that each passage has only one meaning.</p></section></aside>
  </div>
</Shell>
<script>import '../lib/puzzle';</script>
